{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49632","headline":"定风波 五 · 李珣","name":"定风波 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘外烟和月满庭，此时闲坐若爲情。\n小阁拥炉残酒醒，愁听，寒风叶落一声声。\n惟恨玉人芳信阻，云雨，屏帷寂寞梦难成。\n斗转更阑心杳杳，将晓，银釭斜照绮琴横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}